# Testing

## Backend

`uv run pytest -q` from `backend/` (packages + apps). Use `CI_DATA_DIR` temp dirs in API tests.

## Frontend

`npm test` (Vitest). `npm run test:e2e` — Chrome channel, indexes `benchmarks/fixtures/fullstack_app` in global setup; reuses running API+dev server when up.

## Fixtures

`synthetic_django`, `fullstack_app`, `layered_fastapi` under `backend/benchmarks/fixtures/`. `score_benchmark.py` scores synthetic Q&A. Do not modify fixture trees in routine tasks.

## Before merge

Same commands as [CONTRIBUTING.md](CONTRIBUTING.md) and `.github/workflows/ci.yml` (minus optional local-only steps).
